contract_change:
  api: "runAction, runWithActiveExtensions, runInActiveExtensionScope, PmClient item-transaction methods (nested calls inside an open extension scope)"
  before: "Any nested call reused the open scope whatever tracker it addressed, ignored a nested noExtensions and a nested cwd in runAction, and a nested runWithActiveExtensions with its own cwd waited for the activation gate"
  after: "A nested call for another tracker activates that tracker in request-local registries; a nested noExtensions call runs in empty registries; a nested cwd other than the current directory is refused with reason nested_cwd_unavailable; runAction publishes its scope, so nested same-tracker work reuses it and a nested extension action dispatches; a scope ends when its callback settles"
  migrate: Inside a scope address a tracker with path instead of cwd. A host that relied on tracker A registrations judging tracker B writes must install the guard in tracker B. Await nested work inside the callback that started it
body: ""
